Your Nakivo License is going to expire on [expires_on]

Could you please advise if you'd like to have your Nakivo license renewed?

Looking forward to your feedback.

Thank you,

Why would you continue the Nakivo Support and Update maintenance

   -

   You gain access to product updates and the new features in the latest
   release
   -

   It allows you to obtain support from Nakivo if any issues do occur in
   backup processes.
   -

   There is an additional fee on the renewal price if it expires (about 25%
   higher). Also, the renewal date is backdated to the date of the last expiry
   date.



